.5(w=1) + R3.6(w=1) + R4.1(w=1) + R4.2(w=1) = 4 -- at limit\n\nAll within budget. Deferred: R4.3 (1 req) + differential tests.\n\n```yaml\n- index: 0\n  title: \"cmd/ln implementation -- core link creation (srd037-ln R1.1, R1.2, R1.3, R1.4)\"\n  dependency: -1\n  description: |\n    deliverable_type: code\n\n    required_reading:\n      - docs/specs/software-requirements/srd037-ln.yaml (full SRD for ln -- read all requirements before starting)\n      - cmd/mkdir/main.go (reference example of a file operation utility in this project)\n      - pkg/sys/sigpipe.go (InstallSIGPIPEHandler implementation for SIGPIPE protocol)\n\n    files:\n      - path: cmd/ln/main.go\n        action: create\n        note: \"ln utility -- core hard link creation, argument parsing, program structure\"\n\n    requirements:\n      - id: R1\n        text: \"Implement srd037-ln R1.1 as specified in the SRD\"\n      - id: R2\n        text: \"Implement srd037-ln R1.2 as specified in the SRD\"\n      - id: R3\n        text: \"Implement srd037-ln R1.3 as specified in the SRD\"\n      - id: R4\n        text: \"Implement srd037-ln R1.4 as specified in the SRD\"\n\n    design_decisions:\n      - id: D1\n        text: \"Call sys.InstallSIGPIPEHandler() at the start of main per the project shared SIGPIPE protocol\"\n      - id: D2\n        text: \"Import sys as github.com/petar-djukic/go-unix-utils/pkg/sys\"\n      - id: D3\n        text: \"Build with go build -o bin/ln ./cmd/ln/ -- the bin/ directory is gitignored\"\n\n    acceptance_criteria:\n      - id: AC1\n        text: \"go build -o bin/ln ./cmd/ln/ succeeds without errors\"\n      - id: AC2\n        text: \"go vet ./cmd/ln/ reports no warnings\"\n      - id: AC3\n        text: \"All four SRD requirements R1.1 through R1.4 are implemented as specified\"\n      - id: AC4\n        text: \"Program structure follows the pattern of other cmd/ packages in the project\"\n\n- index: 1\n  title: \"cmd/ln implementation -- symbolic links and overwrite fla